VARIABLES state
Inv1 == \A entry_1 \in ccb_log : Cardinality(entry_1.approvers \cap ValidSigners) >= 2
Inv2 == \A i_2 \in 2..Len(ccb_log) : ccb_log[i_2].prev_hash = Hash(ccb_log[i_2-1])
Inv3 == \A entry_3 \in ccb_log : entry_3.final = TRUE => Cardinality(entry_3.approvers) >= 2
